==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Linoone}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Galarian Linoone|118}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Rear Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Rapidash|44}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

